    "Actual memory fields: system_used_mb (max 16268 MB), swap_used_mb (max 3950 MB)",
    "tile-ram-used uses system_used_mb — label changed to 'Peak RAM Used MB'",
    "chart-memory uses system_used_mb with label 'System RAM Used MB'",
    "gamepulse.compatibility.proton_version: ABSENT from session docs — omitted from table",
    "gamepulse.audio.backend: NOT a session stream field — omitted from session table",
    "Session table columns: game.name, session.id (row key), gpu.model, driver_version, host.os.kernel"
  ],
  "schema_notes": [
    "No new 9.5.0 deviations beyond those captured in games-dashboard.json schema_notes",
    "Dual-axis XY chart: CONFIRMED WORKING — single layer, second y-metric gets 'axis': 'y2' (not 'right'). Valid axis values: 'y' (left) and 'y2' (right). Error said 'right' invalid, revealed allowed enum.",
    "Memory field mismatch: spec asked for used_pct/total_mb but memory stream has system_used_mb/swap_used_mb only"
